### 3 cli render trip.x.md --format text
$ xmd render trip.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[€450]:hotel
[usd] := to(hotel, USD) = $490.50
[nvda] := quote(NVDA) = €42.50

## Sunday, September 20, 2026 · Oaxaca 0 stops · in 3 days · 24°C / 12°C · light rain · 40% rain

## Friday, November 20, 2026 · Oaxaca 0 stops · in 64 days · 25°C / 14°C · seasonal outlook (estimate) · 50% rain

## Saturday, December 5, 2026 · Oaxaca 0 stops · in 79 days · no forecast yet; seasonal outlooks cover about 7 months

### 4 cli query trip.x.md values | select {name, display} --json
$ xmd query trip.x.md values | select {name, display} --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "display": "€450",
